<title>MALAYSIA: United Engineers 3-mth net up 55.5 pct.</title>
<headline>United Engineers 3-mth net up 55.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 139.50   vs	  89.68</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 17.9    vs	  14.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   943.28   vs	 674.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   189.90   vs	 126.99</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  25.69   vs  less  18.15</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - United Engineers (Malaysia) Bhd is engaged in infrastrcuture construction and the operation of toll highways.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
